<span class=3D"cite-bracket">[</span>97<span class=3D"cite-bracket">]</span=
></a></sup> <a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Automated_planning_and=
_scheduling" title=3D"Automated planning and scheduling">planning</a> (usin=
g <a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Decision_network" class=3D"mw-re=
