edia.org/wiki/Machine_perception" title=3D"Machine perception">perception</=
a> (using <a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dynamic_Bayesian_network=
" title=3D"Dynamic Bayesian network">dynamic Bayesian networks</a>).<sup id=
