id=3D"cite_ref-VentureBeat_8_August_2024_158-0" class=3D"reference"><a href=
=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Artificial_intelligence#cite_note-Venture=
Beat_8_August_2024-158"><span class=3D"cite-bracket">[</span>148<span class=
=3D"cite-bracket">]</span></a></sup> In January 2025, Microsoft proposed th=
e technique <i>rStar-Math</i> that leverages <a href=3D"https://en.wikipedi=
a.org/wiki/Monte_Carlo_tree_search" title=3D"Monte Carlo tree search">Monte=
 Carlo tree search</a> and step-by-step reasoning, enabling a relatively sm=
all language model like <i>Qwen-7B</i> to solve 53% of the <a href=3D"https=
://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/American_Invitational_Mathematics_Examination" tit=
