-159"><span class=3D"cite-bracket">[</span>149<span class=3D"cite-bracket">=
]</span></a></sup> <a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Google_DeepMind=
" title=3D"Google DeepMind">Google DeepMind</a> has developed models for so=
lving mathematical problems: <i>AlphaTensor</i>, <i><a href=3D"https://en.w=
ikipedia.org/wiki/AlphaGeometry" title=3D"AlphaGeometry">AlphaGeometry</a><=
/i>, <i>AlphaProof</i> and <i><a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alph=
