<div class=3D"mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id=3D"Finance">Finance</h3></div>
<p>According to Nicolas Firzli, director of the <a href=3D"https://en.wikip=
edia.org/wiki/World_Pensions_%26_Investments_Forum" title=3D"World Pensions=
 &amp; Investments Forum">World Pensions &amp; Investments Forum</a>, it ma=
y be too early to see the emergence of highly innovative AI-informed financ=
ial products and services. He argues that "the deployment of AI tools will =
simply further automatise things: destroying tens of thousands of jobs in b=
anking, financial planning, and pension advice in the process, but I'm not =
