ificial_intelligence_bloomberg2-172"><span class=3D"cite-bracket">[</span>1=
62<span class=3D"cite-bracket">]</span></a></sup>
</p><p>The prevalence of generative AI tools has increased significantly si=
nce the <a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/AI_boom" title=3D"AI boom"=
>AI boom</a> in the 2020s. This boom was made possible by improvements in <=
a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deep_learning" title=3D"Deep learni=
ng">deep</a> <a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neural_networks" clas=
s=3D"mw-redirect" title=3D"Neural networks">neural networks</a>, particular=
ly <a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Large_language_model" title=3D"=
Large language model">large language models</a> (LLMs), which are based on =
the <a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Transformer_(machine_learning_=
model)" class=3D"mw-redirect" title=3D"Transformer (machine learning model)=
">transformer</a> architecture. Generative AI applications include <a href=
