TELaw_Library_of_Congress_(U.S.)._Global_Legal_Research_Directorate2019_348=
-0" class=3D"reference"><a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Artificial=
_intelligence#cite_note-FOOTNOTELaw_Library_of_Congress_(U.S.)._Global_Lega=
