s=3D"cite-bracket">]</span></a></sup><sup id=3D"cite_ref-FOOTNOTEStanford_U=
niversity2023_350-0" class=3D"reference"><a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.or=
g/wiki/Artificial_intelligence#cite_note-FOOTNOTEStanford_University2023-35=
0"><span class=3D"cite-bracket">[</span>333<span class=3D"cite-bracket">]</=
