class=3D"reference"><a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Artificial_int=
elligence#cite_note-369"><span class=3D"cite-bracket">[</span>r<span class=
=3D"cite-bracket">]</span></a></sup> They developed several areas of resear=
ch that would become part of AI,<sup id=3D"cite_ref-370" class=3D"reference=
"><a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Artificial_intelligence#cite_not=
e-370"><span class=3D"cite-bracket">[</span>352<span class=3D"cite-bracket"=
>]</span></a></sup> such as <a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Warren=
_Sturgis_McCulloch" title=3D"Warren Sturgis McCulloch">McCulloch</a> and <a=
 href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Walter_Pitts" title=3D"Walter Pitts"=
