://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Artificial_intelligence#cite_note-402"><span class=
=3D"cite-bracket">[</span>377<span class=3D"cite-bracket">]</span></a></sup=
> <a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Graphics_processing_unit" title=
=3D"Graphics processing unit">graphics processing units</a>, <a href=3D"htt=
ps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cloud_computing" title=3D"Cloud computing">cloud=
 computing</a><sup id=3D"cite_ref-FOOTNOTEClark2015b_403-0" class=3D"refere=
nce"><a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Artificial_intelligence#cite_=
note-FOOTNOTEClark2015b-403"><span class=3D"cite-bracket">[</span>378<span =
class=3D"cite-bracket">]</span></a></sup>) and access to <a href=3D"https:/=
/en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Big_data" title=3D"Big data">large amounts of data</=
a><sup id=3D"cite_ref-404" class=3D"reference"><a href=3D"https://en.wikipe=
dia.org/wiki/Artificial_intelligence#cite_note-404"><span class=3D"cite-bra=
cket">[</span>379<span class=3D"cite-bracket">]</span></a></sup> (including=
