ference"><a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Artificial_intelligence#c=
ite_note-FOOTNOTEClark2015b-403"><span class=3D"cite-bracket">[</span>378<s=
pan class=3D"cite-bracket">]</span></a></sup> such as <a href=3D"https://en=
.wikipedia.org/wiki/ImageNet" title=3D"ImageNet">ImageNet</a>). Deep learni=
ng's success led to an enormous increase in interest and funding in AI.<sup=
 id=3D"cite_ref-405" class=3D"reference"><a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.or=
g/wiki/Artificial_intelligence#cite_note-405"><span class=3D"cite-bracket">=
